      "$e^x + e^y y' = e^{x+y} + e^{x+y} y'$.",
      "$y'(e^y - e^{x+y}) = e^{x+y} - e^x$.",
      "Substitute $e^{x+y} = e^x + e^y$:",
      "$y'(e^y - (e^x + e^y)) = (e^x + e^y) - e^x$.",
      "$y'(-e^x) = e^y \\Rightarrow y' = -\\frac{e^y}{e^x} = -e^{y-x}$."
